BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:5th Annual Hematology and Oncology Updates for the Advanced Practi
 ce Provider
DTSTART:20260918T120000Z
DTEND:20260919T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260731T203835Z
UID:winship-6715@seminar-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Event type: Lectures and Training\n\nHosted by Winship Cancer 
 Institute of Emory University\, the 5th Annual Hematology and Oncology Upd
 ates for the Advanced Practice Provider is a two-day continuing education 
 program designed to provide APPs with the latest\, evidence-based strategi
 es to optimize care and outcomes for patients with cancer. Advancing Knowl
 edge. Recognizing Excellence. Building Connections. Our conference is desi
 gned to promote learning\, expand the knowledge of NPs and PAs\, and suppo
 rt professional growth through engaging educational sessions and updates i
 n clinical practice. We proudly recognize the accomplishments and contribu
 tions of our APPs through special awards presentations celebrating excelle
 nce within our profession. Beyond the educational experience\, we foster m
 eaningful connections and relationships through networking opportunities\,
  including our highly anticipated bowling alley event — a favorite among
  attendees from last year’s conference. Attendees will also enjoy fun an
 d practical conference giveaways as an added thank-you for being part of o
 ur conference experience. Dates: Friday\, September 18 (all day) and Satur
 day\, September 19\, 2026 (half day) Credits: This conference is approved 
 for 13 hours of AAPA Category 1 CME credits from the AAPA Review Panel. Au
 dience: This conference is designed for advanced practice providers\, incl
 uding nurse practitioners\, physician assistants\, pharmacists\, nurses an
 d APP students.\n\nWinship event page: https://apps.winshipcancer.emory.ed
 u/admin/Event/6715/5th-annual-hematology-and-oncology-updates-for-the-adva
 nced-practice-provider/
LOCATION:Emory Conference Center Hotel 1615 Clifton Road NE Atlanta \, Geo
 rgia 30329
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://apps.winshipcancer.emory.edu/admin/Event/6715/5th-annual-hemat
 ology-and-oncology-updates-for-the-advanced-practice-provider/
END:VEVENT
